# Toolchain & Project Structure

## Language

**C11** (`-std=c11`). **No C++.**

## Compiler flags (from `Makefile`)

```
-std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror
-D_POSIX_C_SOURCE=200809L
-Iinclude
-O2          # release
```

Debug target adds `-g -O1 -fsanitize=address,undefined -fno-omit-frame-pointer`.

## Compiler selection

`Makefile` picks **gcc** if available, else **clang**:

```makefile
CC := $(shell command -v gcc >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo gcc || echo clang)
```

## Build system

**GNU Make** at repo root. Single link step for the main binary (no separate
`.o` rules).

| Target | Output |
|--------|--------|
| `make` / `all` | `true-toto` |
| `make debug` | `true-toto-debug` |
| `make test` | builds + runs `tests/test_core` |
| `make clean` | removes `true-toto`, `true-toto-debug`, `tests/test_core` |
| `make install` | `install -m 755 true-toto /usr/local/bin` (Linux/macOS; needs sudo) |

**Main sources:** `src/main.c`, `src/true_toto_emit.c`, `src/true_toto_cli.c`

**Test sources:** `tests/test_runner.c`, `tests/test_scan_no_args.c`,
`tests/test_scan_help.c`, `tests/test_scan_help_short.c`,
`tests/test_scan_version.c`, `tests/test_scan_version_short.c`,
`tests/test_scan_help_wins.c`, `tests/test_scan_ignored_args.c`

**Test binary also links:** `src/true_toto_cli.c`, `src/true_toto_emit.c`
— but **not** `src/main.c`.

## Dependencies

**libc only** — no extra `-l` flags. POSIX headers: `unistd.h`, etc.

